; jumpz-branch: JUMPZ branch taken
; Push 0 → JUMPZ skips PUSH 99 → lands on PUSH 42 → OUTNUM → HALT
; Expected output: 42

PUSH 0         ; 0: condition = 0 (branch will be taken)
JUMPZ skip     ; 1: zero → jump to 'skip'
PUSH 99        ; 2: skipped
skip:
PUSH 42        ; 3: target of JUMPZ
OUTNUM         ; 4: prints 42
HALT           ; 5
